 "text": "-->\nHome | Harper County Kansas\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nHome\nGovernment\nAppraiser\nClerk\nCommissioners\nDept on Aging & Transportation\nElections\nHR\nHealth\nPublic Works\nRegister of Deeds\nTreasurer\nPublic Safety\nAttorney\nDispatch\nDistrict Court\nEMS\nEmergency Management\nSheriff\nCommunity\nChildcare\nEmployment Opportunities\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nLog In\nHarper County Kansas\nCONTACT US\nHarper County\nGeneral Election to be held November 3, 2026.\nPreliminary Results May be Found Here on Election Night.\nVoter Registration Closes October 13th.\nEarly Voting begins Wednesday, October 14th.\nElection Audit will be held Thursday, November 5th at 3:00 in the County Clerk's Office.\nCanvass will be held Monday, November 16th at 10:00am.\nUnder Kansas statute, the deadline to return your ballot is the close of the polls on Election Day. A district court judge in Douglas County has entered a temporary injunction altering that deadline. However, the Secretary of State, represented by the Attorney General, has filed a motion with the Kansas Appellate Courts to stay the decision so that the deadline remains the close of the polls on Election Day. Because of the legal uncertainty while the matter is pending on appeal, voters are urged to return their ballots by the close of the polls on Election Day. Doing so will ensure that their ballots will be counted.\nGo to our Elections Page for further Information\nREVENUE NEUTRAL RATE\nFrequently Asked Questions:\nCLICK HERE FOR RNR HEARING INFORMATION\nGovernment\nPublic Safety\nCommunity\nWhy Choose Harper County Kansas?\nx\nLive\nYour Video Title\nUnmute\n00:00 00:00\nCONTACT US\nfor general county calls:\n620-842-5555\n201 N. Jennings Ave.\nAnthony, KS 67003\nRemote Support\nBE THE FIRST TO KNOW\nAlways know when minutes, agendas, and news is posted\nSubscribe Now\nThanks for submitting!\ndocument center\nproperty search\npay taxes\nemployment\ntransportation\n© 2023-24 Harper County, KS -\nbuilt by KanOkla Design Studio\nbottom of page",
